title: Bowire
description: >-
  The API workbench that embeds in your own service.
  Loads an AsyncAPI 2.x or 3.0 document and turns its channels into methods you
  can publish to and subscribe from, over MQTT, Kafka, WebSocket, AMQP and the
  other transports Bowire speaks - in a browser UI, from the CLI or through an
  AI agent over MCP.
